# ── build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────
/tanulom
/bin/
# The embedded SPA is produced by the Dockerfile / DEVELOPMENT.md build steps.
# Only the .gitkeep is tracked, so //go:embed all:dist still compiles on a fresh
# clone before anyone has run `npm run build`.
backend/internal/web/dist/*
!backend/internal/web/dist/.gitkeep
# A tracked placeholder so a fresh clone compiles (//go:embed needs a real file)
# and the SPA-fallback test has something to serve. Overwritten by the build.
!backend/internal/web/dist/index.html
web-ui/dist/
web-ui/node_modules/
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── runtime data — never commit a learner's database ──────────
/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ── the embedded starter pack — TRACKED ON PURPOSE ────────────
# backend/internal/lang/starter/*.gz is committed, not generated at build time,
# and no pattern here may come to cover it. //go:embed on a missing file is a
# COMPILE ERROR, so ignoring these would mean a fresh clone cannot build the
# backend at all — and a binary built without them would boot with no language
# pack, which is the exact state [ADR-010] removes. ~16 MB, refreshed by
# `make starter`, which is rare.

# ── Piper voice models — fetched, not committed ───────────────
# 60 MB each and redistributable from rhasspy/piper-voices, so they are a
# download rather than a repository. `make voices` fetches them; only the small
# .json voice cards are tracked, which is what records WHICH three voices the
# ear trainer expects and under what licence.
langpack/voices/*.onnx

# ── language pack build artefacts ─────────────────────────────
langpack/cache/
langpack/.venv/
langpack/build/
/dist/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# ── media ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/media/
*.wav
*.opus
*.webm

# ── research PDFs that may not be redistributed ───────────────
# See .claude/research/pdf/README.md for the per-file ledger.
# These are held locally for reference but must not be published.
.claude/research/pdf/02-cepeda-2006-distributed-practice.pdf
.claude/research/pdf/02-spacing-benefit-metaanalysis.pdf

# ── editor / OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ── secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
config.local.yaml
dist/
